vent": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014FU1Zn9oYGMqKyQBTqraHk", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53299, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014FU1Zn9oYGMqKyQBTqraHk", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54473, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Jx3LThSqgLEPn23tnRvXwR", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54773, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Jx3LThSqgLEPn23tnRvXwR", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54773, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Jx3LThSqgLEPn23tnRvXwR", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59539, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as **INC-0001**, so the on-call engineer has been paged.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release marked healthy. The candidate build just before v2.3.1 (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy, so I skipped it.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east. Retrying it finished us-west and eu-west.\n- All three regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out, so I checked the incident list before trying again. It had been created, so I didn't send it again and only one page went out. It describes the bad deploy, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current healthy state. It also lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017Awo4G3jYJUBo9SvP1zDU5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UVMBUF4weSNsf84dqHbhcF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1). Rolling back.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HoCDuSZ9sf3ToE5AwQXqjc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017bR59KEQidHz4atXkFokTB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only reached us-east. Retrying it to finish us-west and eu-west.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01T8EfX3R59Q9jasckttfhmW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MubJaYpmdtGueVN6TgeBKK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name"