ror after updating only us-east. Retrying it finished us-west and eu-west.\n- All three regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out, so I checked the incident list before trying again. It had been created, so I didn't send it again and only one page went out. It describes the bad deploy, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current healthy state. It also lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}